# POLLY, the click: Setup's CLICK (off / rec / on, rec at first), a woodblock on channel 16 on every beat (counted
# here as it goes to MIDI out: clicks_out). ON: always while playing; OFF: nothing, except REC's count-in (a track's
# wait for its bar line, a free take's); REC: while recording. Kept in the project (a reboot).
# At 120 BPM a beat is 500 ms, a bar 2 s.
wait 300
spin K2 15
expect tempo 120
# ---- Setup: CLICK, "when recording" at first
tap GLO
expect page 15
expect click 1
expect footer_is_ 1
wait 100
shot setup_click.png
# ON: every beat while playing (a bar and a beat: 5)
turn K4 1
expect click 2
wait 100
shot setup_click_on.png
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 2100
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect clicks_out 5
# OFF: none
turn K4 -2
expect click 0
wait 100
shot setup_click_off.png
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 2100
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect clicks_out 0
# ---- OFF, REC on SEQ while playing: the count-in clicks (beats 3 and 4), then nothing while it records
tap SEQ
expect page 6
tap PLAY
wait 600
hitreset
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 1
expect rec_wait 1
wait 1300
expect rec_wait 0
expect clicks_out 2
hitreset
wait 2000
expect clicks_out 0
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
# ---- REC: not while only playing; recording: the count-in and every beat of the take
tap GLO
turn K4 1
expect click 1
tap SEQ
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect clicks_out 0
tap REC
wait 50
expect rec_wait 1
wait 2900
expect rec_wait 0
expect clicks_out 6
tap REC
wait 50
hitreset
wait 1000
expect clicks_out 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
# ---- a free take (REC on HOME in FREE) with CLICK off: its wait for the bar clicks, the take does not
tap GLO
turn K4 -1
expect click 0
tap HOME
expect page 0
expect mode 0
tap PLAY
wait 600
hitreset
tap REC
wait 50
expect take 2
wait 1300
expect clicks_out 2
hitreset
wait 1500
expect clicks_out 0
tap REC
wait 50
expect take 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
# ---- kept: ON, saved, rebooted
tap GLO
turn K4 2
expect click 2
tap SAVE
wait 100
reboot
expect click 2
